{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover SCP-682's full potential?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you wondered what this immortal lizard look like if she evolved endlessly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly Evolution is a strategy clicker game where your goal is to evolve our lizard mommy from a single cell to an immortal Lovecraftian god!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 anomalies to evolve! SCP-682, SCP-1471 and SCP-999</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 unique evolutions to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 animated scenes to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlockable gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scaling difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >immersive soundtrack</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I've mentioned, Anomaly Evolution is a clicker game in which you main click on your creature and generate &quot;cells&quot;, which are your primary currency in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can then use cells to unlock new ways of generating cells at a larger and faster rate, repeating an endless cycle of anomalous growth! You'll also need to unlock more features and types as you grow. These are the current types in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proteins:\u00a0You use them to increase the maximum level capacity of your upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neurons: You need them to multiply the amount of cells you gain from each click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genes: These are needed to increase the amount of cells you gain from clicking. The more genes you have, the more cells you gain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morphogens:\u00a0Uses neurons to generate more cells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tissues: Each tissue is an auto clicker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enzymes:\u00a0You need them to increase your damage against the hostile Xenocytes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evocytes:\u00a0Special immortal cells that you need to &quot;TRANSCEND&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/extras/cad4cfb12aa53b64eeb84aff7565c72e.avif?t=1773234856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/extras_big/cad4cfb12aa53b64eeb84aff7565c72e.avif?t=1773234856 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transcendence:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mechanic in the game in which you reset your current progress and growth in exchange for a permanent boost in all cell production rates, including your evocyte production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evocytes are gained from killing Xenocytes, which are hostile cells that appear in the game. They can be killed by clicking them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Will you able to reach all of their evolutionary forms?</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/extras/67ba96e6091add4ce99c35269a7c2960.avif?t=1773234856\" width=460 height=200 /></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443400?t=1773234856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443400?t=1773234856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/41fbf7cd4b3e3b481a2b3d3bbde3154b69de2a25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773234856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/41fbf7cd4b3e3b481a2b3d3bbde3154b69de2a25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773234856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player"