e genes you have, the more cells you gain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morphogens:\u00a0Uses neurons to generate more cells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tissues: Each tissue is an auto clicker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enzymes:\u00a0You need them to increase your damage against the hostile Xenocytes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evocytes:\u00a0Special immortal cells that you need to &quot;TRANSCEND&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/extras/cad4cfb12aa53b64eeb84aff7565c72e.avif?t=1773234856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/extras_big/cad4cfb12aa53b64eeb84aff7565c72e.avif?t=1773234856 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transcendence:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mechanic in the game in which you reset your current progress and growth in exchange for a permanent boost in all cell production rates, including your evocyte production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evocytes are gained from killing Xenocytes, which are hostile cells that appear in the game. They can be killed by clicking them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Will you able to reach all of their evolutionary forms?</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/extras/67ba96e6091add4ce99c35269a7c2960.avif?t=1773234856\" width=460 height=200 /></span></h2>","developers":["TentaclesGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443400/header.jpg?t=1773234856","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\"SCP-682\" by Dr Gears and Epic Phail Spy, from the SCP Wiki. Source: https://scpwiki.com/scp-682. Licensed under CC BY-SA.<br />\r\n\"SCP-1471\" by